    <p class="regular-panel-title">Signals happening regularly, these deserve your attention first</p>
    <ul class="regular-list" id="regular-list"></ul>
    <p class="regular-note">The signals you have confirmed as recurring in this section are the interpretive foundation of your record. They tell you that what you are seeing is real, that it is not normal aging alone, and that it is significant enough to carry into the next section and beyond.</p>
